ek din mein bhare ghar ko luttay huwe dekhi hoon<br>
zainab ne kaha bhai ko marte huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
1. jab qasim e muztar ka pamal huwa lasha<br>
kuch pal mei hi kubra bhi dulhan se bani bewa<br>
aur kubra ko bewa mai bante huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
2. yeh aun o mohammed ki kya wada wafai hai<br>
bachou ne mere sheh pe jaan apni lutai hai<br>
lashou pe main bhai ko rote huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
3. aramaan tha mera ke dulha mai banaoogi<br>
mere ali akber ka sehra mai sajaoogi<br>
ab usko jawani mein marte huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
4. nanha ali asgher jab nusrat ke liye pohcha<br>
ek teer se zalim ne masoom gala cheda<br>
besheer ka manka mai dhalte huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
5. masoom se bache the aur tashnadahani thi<br>
aur samne nazrou ke dariya ki rawani th<br>
mai pyass se bachou ko marte huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
6. haai yaad mujhe ab tak lamhe woh judai ke<br>
ro ro ke lipatjana bachi ka woh qadmou se<br>
bhai ko suey maqtal jatay huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
7. mai qaime se takti thi iss khoon bhare manzar ko<br>
par rok na payi main chalte huwe khanjar ko<br>
sar tan se juda sheh ka hote huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
8. jab shaam e ghareeba mein chadar meri chinti thi<br>
mai barha ghazy ko awaz lagati thi<br>
abbas ke laashe ko sehme huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
9. mai samne thairi thi aur jalte rahe qaime<br>
ruqsar sakina ke neele the tamachou se<br>
bimaar ka bistar mai jalte huwe dekhi hoon<br>
<br>
10. ashoor ko dekhe hain maine yeh sabhi manzar<br>
dil hilta hai rahil ka zainab ka bayan sunkar<br>
ek din mei bhare ghar ko luttay huwe dekhi hoon